+    /// consistent estimator for normally distributed data.
+    ///
+    /// Both the median and the MAD are computed over the finite elements of
+    /// the window only. Any non-finite values are marked as outliers. Elements
+    /// deviating from their window median by less than `minimumDeviation` are
+    /// not reported.
